{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"追问对方是否愿意继续靠近的急切忽然退下，熟悉的温柔和安静短暂回来。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S07\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M27\", \"M28\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S07让他看见，反复追问不能确认对方是否愿意继续靠近；急切稍退，原有的亲近便重新显出。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S07\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M28\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"可这份安静刚被重新认出，就很快淡下去，没能让他重新安顿。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S06\", \"S07\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M29\", \"M32\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"亲近不能替对方作答，反复追问也不能；所以温柔回来，仍没让他知道对方是否愿意继续靠近。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S06\", \"S07\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M2\", \"M8\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"温柔里仍有一点心酸，他的期待并没有随安静一起退下。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S07\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M2\", \"M6\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S07让他知道，反复追问不能确认对方是否愿意继续靠近；这份盼望仍没有得到回应。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S07\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M2\", \"M6\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，追问的急切暂退后，温柔虽会短暂回来，但等待对方是否愿意继续靠近并未因此结束。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "34f40d61-22ca-41bd-a989-ffd8492b403f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T000204551899Z", "elapsed_seconds": 185.312, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T00:05:09.879646+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_